{"hw":"ποιόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ποιόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ποιόω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ποιός</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make of a certain quality,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ποιοῦν αὐτῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">CP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1.5</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be endowed with quality,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Stoic.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.220</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">M.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.108</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σῶμα τοιόνδε οἷον ποιωθὲν ψυχῆς εἰδώλῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plot.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.1.11</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3.26</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ πεποιωμένον τῷ οἴνῳ γάλα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sor.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.95</span> </span>.</div></div>"}